    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>One declared per-agent variable — name, type, and initial value. Authored on <ref refid="class_u_tryll_workflow_asset_1a5abe5406718b15eb9e6e00bcdfeb080b" kindref="member">UTryllWorkflowAsset::Variables</ref>; the complete list is sent once in CreateAgentRequest and locks each variable&apos;s type for the agent&apos;s lifetime. Only one of the value fields is meaningful, selected by Type — the Details customization shows only that field. </para>
